    {
      "uid": "zhcn:797f6e6a3a518127d3ad4ef2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我非常赞同她的这个提议。我也想看老师的笑容。\n发自内心的笑容，无论如何都想见到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e7f5599a3a4550f25c0cd6ed0cf3201832c131e276a3b6baecf43231b9ead30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
